  "limits": "Square grid tiles only; no offset, herringbone or hexagonal layouts (see the tiled floor generator for geometry layouts). The bevel is a bump effect, not geometry. Colour variation is a mix of two glaze colours per tile, not crackle or pooling. Rendered here with Cycles CPU only. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
